# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# The widget ships from a STABLE filename on purpose — the embed snippet is meant to be
# copy-pasteable and not change every build — so without this a returning visitor keeps
# executing whatever they cached. Pages defaults to max-age=14400, four hours, which is
# four hours of a judge reloading and still seeing the previous deploy.
#
# Found the honest way: a fix that was correctly deployed looked like a code bug for ten
# minutes, because the page under test was still running the build before it.
#
# no-cache does not mean "never cache" — it means "revalidate before use". An unchanged
# asset costs a 304. For a demo site at this size that trade is free.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
